# Entity Page Template

Entity pages aggregate information about specific people, organizations, or things.

## Frontmatter

```yaml
---
type: entity
title: "Entity Name"
entity_type: person | organization | location | product | event
created: YYYY-MM-DD
updated: YYYY-MM-DD
tags: [tag1, tag2]
aliases: ["Alternative Name", "Abbreviation"]
---
```

## Body Structure

```markdown
# Entity Name

## Overview

Brief description of what/who this entity is (2-3 sentences).

## Details

### For People
- **Role**: Current position or primary role
- **Affiliation**: Organization association
- **Notable Works**: Key contributions

### For Organizations
- **Type**: Company, non-profit, government, etc.
- **Industry**: Sector or field
- **Founded**: Date and location

### For Locations
- **Type**: City, country, region, etc.
- **Coordinates**: Latitude/longitude if relevant
- **Significance**: Why this location matters

## Sources Mentioning This Entity

- [[source-001|Source Title]] - Context of mention
- [[source-002|Another Source]] - How they relate

## Related Entities

- [[entity-004|Related Person]] - Nature of relationship
- [[entity-005|Parent Organization]] - Hierarchical connection

## Related Concepts

- [[concept-003|Key Concept]] - How this entity embodies or relates to the concept
```

